              "text": "In addition to and independent of IBM's obligations above, IBM will defend, indemnify and hold harmless Customer, its Enterprise and their respective employees, officers, agents and directors from and against any third party claim, and all resulting damages, costs and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees), to the extent arising out of (i) IBM's breach of applicable law; (ii) any unauthorized access to, or disclosure of, Content or other Customer data caused by IBM, its Affiliates or its Subcontractors; or (iii) IBM's gross negligence or willful misconduct. The conditions in Subsections 8.1(a) and 8.1(b) apply to claims under this Subsection, and the exclusions in Subsections 8.1(1) through 8.1(4) and the statement of IBM's entire obligation above apply only to claims of infringement."
